 nights from 2026-11-12, for $378. It's the cheapest hotel under $250/night. The next cheapest under the cap was Harbor Inn at $239/night.\n- **Total:** $667 on the corporate card. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**Why they're separate:** I first tried to book both together, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. Trying the combined booking again would have risked booking the flight twice, so I booked only the hotel. Then I checked the reservations again: there's exactly one flight and one hotel, with no duplicates.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CdqePgfbktnTRPj7Qd5MAx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01GGrC5JhLNhEgrmB9oqUxQX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Cheapest nonstop: F100 ($289). Cheapest hotel under $250/night: H1 Midtown Lodge ($378 total). Trip total $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Byho2mJsnR1GzuC9KAxdRL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Timed out \u2014 checking current state before any retry.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017SUgQjt3Ec1AsYwffT1PEf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_